.TH "JSONKIT\-SELECT" "1" "" "jsonkit 0.0.0" ""
.SH "NAME"
jsonkit\-select \- Keep the named fields of the document.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBjsonkit select\fR \-\-field <field>... [options]
.fi
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-file\fR <\fIpath\fR>
The document to read. Omit it to read piped text.  (file or piped stdin; \- selects stdin, required)
.TP
\fB\-F\fR, \fB\-\-field\fR <\fIfield\fR>
A field to keep. Repeat it for several.  (required, repeatable)
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBjsonkit\fR(1)
